{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1","type":"text","text":"effective  [ɪˈfektɪv]\n*effectively, effectiveness*\n\n**adj.** 有效的；生效的\n\n**例句：** The new policy has been effective in reducing crime.\n新政策在减少犯罪方面已经生效。\n","x":-440,"y":-100,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"2","type":"text","text":"perspective  [pəˈspektɪv]\n*perspectively*\n\n**n.** 观点；视角；远景\n\n**例句：** We need to consider the problem from different perspectives.\n我们需要从不同的角度考虑这个问题。\n","x":-440,"y":240,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"3","type":"text","text":"contrary  [ˈkɒntreri]\n*contrarily, contrariness*\n\n**adj.** 相反的；对立的\n**n.** 相反；反面\n\n**例句：** Contrary to popular belief, not all cats hate water.\n与普遍看法相反，并非所有的猫都讨厌水。\n","x":-440,"y":580,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"4","type":"text","text":"shock  [ʃɒk]\n*shocking, shocked, shockingly*\n\n**n.** 震惊；休克；冲击\n**v.** 使震惊；震动\n\n**例句：** The news of his death came as a great shock to us.\n他去世的消息使我们大为震惊。\n","x":160,"y":-100,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"5","type":"text","text":"charge  [tʃɑːdʒ]\n*charging, charged, chargeable*\n\n**n.** 电荷；费用；责任；指控\n**v.** 充电；收费；指责\n\n**例句：** How much do you charge for this service?\n这项服务你收费多少？\n","x":160,"y":240,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"6","type":"text","text":"philosopher  [fəˈlɒsəfə(r)]\n*philosophical, philosophically, philosophy*\n\n**n.** 哲学家；思想家\n\n**例句：** Socrates was a famous ancient Greek philosopher.\n苏格拉底是著名的古希腊哲学家。\n","x":160,"y":580,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"7","type":"text","text":"operate  [ˈɒpəreɪt]\n*operating, operated, operation, operator*\n\n**v.** 操作；运转；动手术\n\n**例句：** The machine operates smoothly.\n这台机器运转平稳。\n","x":760,"y":-100,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"8","type":"text","text":"elite  [eɪˈliːt]\n*elitist, elitism*\n\n**n.** 精英；上层人士\n\n**例句：** The company only hires the elite from top universities.\n该公司只从顶尖大学招聘精英。\n","x":760,"y":240,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"9","type":"text","text":"gender  [ˈdʒendə(r)]\n*gendered, gendering, genderless*\n\n**n.** 性别；性\n\n**例句：** The company is committed to gender equality in the workplace.\n该公司致力于工作场所的性别平等。\n","x":760,"y":580,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"10","type":"text","text":"accomplish  [əˈkʌmplɪʃ]\n*accomplishing, accomplished, accomplishment*\n\n**v.** 完成；实现\n\n**例句：** She accomplished her goal of becoming a doctor.\n她实现了成为医生的目标。\n","x":-440,"y":920,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"11","type":"text","text":"oppose  [əˈpəʊz]\n*opposing, opposed, opposition, opponent*\n\n**v.** 反对；反抗\n\n**例句：** Many people oppose the new law.\n许多人反对这项新法律。\n","x":160,"y":920,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"12","type":"text","text":"boom  [buːm]\n*booming, boomed*\n\n**n.** 繁荣；激增\n**v.** 繁荣；迅速发展\n\n**例句：** The economy is experiencing a boom.\n经济正在经历繁荣。\n","x":760,"y":920,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"13","type":"text","text":"planet  [ˈplænɪt]\n*planetary*\n\n**n.** 行星\n\n**例句：** Earth is the third planet from the sun.\n地球是太阳系中离太阳第三近的行星。\n","x":-440,"y":1260,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"14","type":"text","text":"council  [ˈkaʊnsl]\n*councillor, councilman, councilwoman*\n\n**n.** 委员会；理事会\n\n**例句：** The city council will meet tomorrow.\n市议会明天将开会。\n","x":160,"y":1260,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"15","type":"text","text":"origin  [ˈɒrɪdʒɪn]\n*original, originally, originality, originate*\n\n**n.** 起源；出身\n\n**例句：** The origin of the universe is still a mystery.\n宇宙的起源仍然是个谜。\n","x":760,"y":1260,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"16","type":"text","text":"union  [ˈjuːniən]\n*unite, united, unity, universal*\n\n**n.** 联合；联盟；工会\n\n**例句：** The two countries formed a union for mutual protection.\n两国为了相互保护而结成联盟。\n","x":-440,"y":1600,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"17","type":"text","text":"movement  [ˈmuːvmənt]\n*move, moving, moved, movable*\n\n**n.** 运动；活动；移动\n\n**例句：** The civil rights movement changed America.\n民权运动改变了美国。\n","x":160,"y":1600,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"18","type":"text","text":"director  [dəˈrektə(r)]\n*direct, directing, directed, direction*\n\n**n.** 导演；主任；董事\n\n**例句：** The director of the company resigned yesterday.\n公司董事昨天辞职了。\n","x":760,"y":1600,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"19","type":"text","text":"engage  [ɪnˈɡeɪdʒ]\n*engaging, engaged, engagement*\n\n**v.** 从事；参与；订婚\n\n**例句：** He engages in social work every weekend.\n他每个周末都从事社会工作。\n","x":-440,"y":1940,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"20","type":"text","text":"creative  [kriˈeɪtɪv]\n*creatively, creativity, create, creation*\n\n**adj.** 创造性的；有创造力的\n\n**例句：** She has a creative mind.\n她有创造性思维。\n","x":160,"y":1940,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"21","type":"text","text":"recession  [rɪˈseʃn]\n*recede, receding, receded*\n\n**n.** 衰退；不景气\n\n**例句：** The country is in a recession.\n这个国家正处于衰退期。\n","x":760,"y":1940,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"22","type":"text","text":"budget  [ˈbʌdʒɪt]\n*budgeting, budgeted*\n\n**n.** 预算\n**v.** 做预算\n\n**例句：** The government has announced a new budget.\n政府已经宣布了新的预算。\n","x":-440,"y":2280,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"23","type":"text","text":"aware  [əˈweə(r)]\n*awareness, unaware*\n\n**adj.** 意识到的；知道的\n\n**例句：** I am aware of the problem.\n我意识到了这个问题。\n","x":160,"y":2280,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"24","type":"text","text":"background  [ˈbækɡraʊnd]\n*backgrounded, backgrounding*\n\n**n.** 背景；出身\n\n**例句：** She has a background in medicine.\n她有医学背景。\n","x":760,"y":2280,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"25","type":"text","text":"refer  [rɪˈfɜː(r)]\n*referring, referred, reference, referee*\n\n**v.** 参考；涉及；提到\n\n**例句：** Please refer to the instructions for details.\n详情请参考说明书。\n","x":-440,"y":2620,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"26","type":"text","text":"essential  [ɪˈsenʃl]\n*essentially, essence*\n\n**adj.** 基本的；必要的\n**n.** 要素；必需品\n\n**例句：** Water is essential for life.\n水是生命所必需的。\n","x":160,"y":2620,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"27","type":"text","text":"ground  [ɡraʊnd]\n*grounding, grounded*\n\n**n.** 地面；基础；理由\n\n**例句：** The ground is wet after the rain.\n雨后地面潮湿。\n","x":760,"y":2620,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"28","type":"text","text":"collection  [kəˈlekʃn]\n*collect, collecting, collected, collective*\n\n**n.** 收集；集合；收藏品\n\n**例句：** She has a large collection of stamps.\n她有大量的邮票收藏品。\n","x":-440,"y":2960,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"29","type":"text","text":"implication  [ˌɪmplɪˈkeɪʃn]\n*imply, implying, implied, implicit*\n\n**n.** 含义；暗示；影响\n\n**例句：** The implication of his statement is clear.\n他的话的含义很清楚。\n","x":160,"y":2960,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"30","type":"text","text":"ban  [bæn]\n*banning, banned*\n\n**v.** 禁止；取缔\n**n.** 禁令\n\n**例句：** The government banned smoking in public places.\n政府禁止在公共场所吸烟。\n","x":760,"y":2960,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"31","type":"text","text":"impose  [ɪmˈpəʊz]\n*imposing, imposed, imposition*\n\n**v.** 强加；征收；施加\n\n**例句：** The government imposed a new tax on alcohol.\n政府对酒精征收新税。\n","x":-440,"y":3300,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"32","type":"text","text":"conflict  [ˈkɒnflɪkt]\n*conflicting, conflicted*\n\n**n.** 冲突；矛盾\n**v.** 冲突；抵触\n\n**例句：** There is a conflict between his personal and professional life.\n他的个人生活和职业生活之间存在冲突。\n","x":160,"y":3300,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"33","type":"text","text":"evolve  [iˈvɒlv]\n*evolving, evolved, evolution, evolutionary*\n\n**v.** 进化；发展；演变\n\n**例句：** Species evolve over time.\n物种随时间进化。\n","x":760,"y":3300,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"34","type":"text","text":"commercial  [kəˈmɜːʃl]\n*commercially, commerce, commercialize*\n\n**adj.** 商业的；贸易的\n**n.** 商业广告\n\n**例句：** The company has a commercial interest in the project.\n该公司对该项目有商业利益。\n","x":-440,"y":3640,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"35","type":"text","text":"presence  [ˈprezns]\n*present, presenting, presented, presentable*\n\n**n.** 存在；出席；在场\n\n**例句：** Her presence brightened up the room.\n她的出现使房间变得明亮起来。\n","x":160,"y":3640,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"36","type":"text","text":"supply  [səˈplaɪ]\n*supplying, supplied, supplier*\n\n**n.** 供应；供给；供应量\n**v.** 供应；提供\n\n**例句：** The supply of water is limited.\n水的供应是有限的。\n","x":760,"y":3640,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"37","type":"text","text":"capture  [ˈkæptʃə(r)]\n*capturing, captured, captive, captivity*\n\n**v.** 捕获；捕获；俘虏\n**n.** 捕获；战利品\n\n**例句：** The police captured the criminal.\n警察捕获了罪犯。\n","x":-440,"y":3980,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"38","type":"text","text":"former  [ˈfɔːmə(r)]\n*formerly, form, forming, formed*\n\n**adj.** 以前的；前者的\n**n.** 前者\n\n**例句：** He is the former president of the company.\n他是公司的前总裁。\n","x":160,"y":3980,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"39","type":"text","text":"ethic  [ˈeθɪk]\n*ethical, ethically, ethics*\n\n**n.** 伦理；道德规范\n\n**例句：** Business ethics is important for companies.\n商业伦理对公司很重要。\n","x":760,"y":3980,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"40","type":"text","text":"remind  [rɪˈmaɪnd]\n*reminding, reminded, reminder*\n\n**v.** 提醒；使想起\n\n**例句：** Please remind me to take my medicine.\n请提醒我吃药。\n","x":-440,"y":4320,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"41","type":"text","text":"wage  [weɪdʒ]\n*waging, waged*\n\n**n.** 工资；报酬\n**v.** 进行；开展\n\n**例句：** He earns a good wage.\n他挣得不错的工资。\n","x":160,"y":4320,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"42","type":"text","text":"complain  [kəmˈpleɪn]\n*complaining, complained, complaint*\n\n**v.** 抱怨；诉苦；投诉\n\n**例句：** She always complains about her job.\n她总是抱怨她的工作。\n","x":760,"y":4320,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"43","type":"text","text":"senior  [ˈsiːniə(r)]\n*seniority, junior*\n\n**adj.** 高级的；年长的\n**n.** 年长者；高年级学生\n\n**例句：** He is a senior manager in the company.\n他是公司的高级经理。\n","x":-440,"y":4660,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"44","type":"text","text":"special  [ˈspeʃl]\n*specially, specialty, specialize*\n\n**adj.** 特殊的；特别的；专门的\n**n.** 特别的东西；特价\n\n**例句：** She has a special talent for music.\n她有音乐方面的特殊天赋。\n","x":160,"y":4660,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"45","type":"text","text":"inform  [ɪnˈfɔːm]\n*informing, informed, information, informative*\n\n**v.** 通知；告知；报告\n\n**例句：** Please inform me of any changes.\n如有任何变化，请通知我。\n","x":760,"y":4660,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"46","type":"text","text":"announce  [əˈnaʊns]\n*announcing, announced, announcement*\n\n**v.** 宣布；公布；通告\n\n**例句：** The company announced a new product.\n公司宣布了一款新产品。\n","x":-440,"y":5000,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"47","type":"text","text":"peer  [pɪə(r)]\n*peering, peered, peerless*\n\n**n.** 同龄人；同等地位的人\n**v.** 凝视；盯着看\n\n**例句：** He is respected by his peers.\n他受到同龄人的尊敬。\n","x":160,"y":5000,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"48","type":"text","text":"switch  [swɪtʃ]\n*switching, switched, switchable*\n\n**n.** 开关；转换；交换机\n**v.** 切换；转换；交换\n\n**例句：** Please switch off the lights when you leave.\n离开时请关灯。\n","x":760,"y":5000,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"49","type":"text","text":"property  [ˈprɒpəti]\n*proper, properly, propertied*\n\n**n.** 财产；资产；性质；特性\n\n**例句：** He owns a lot of property.\n他拥有大量财产。\n","x":-440,"y":5340,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"50","type":"text","text":"expression  [ɪkˈspreʃn]\n*express, expressing, expressed, expressive*\n\n**n.** 表达；表情；表达方式\n\n**例句：** She had a sad expression on her face.\n她脸上带着悲伤的表情。\n","x":160,"y":5340,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"51","type":"text","text":"perceive  [pəˈsiːv]\n*perceiving, perceived, perception, perceptive*\n\n**v.** 感知；察觉；理解\n\n**例句：** I perceive a change in his attitude.\n我察觉到他的态度有所变化。\n","x":760,"y":5340,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"52","type":"text","text":"trial  [ˈtraɪəl]\n*try, trying, tried*\n\n**n.** 审判；试验；试用\n\n**例句：** The case went to trial.\n这个案子进入了审判程序。\n","x":-440,"y":5680,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"53","type":"text","text":"demonstrate  [ˈdemənstreɪt]\n*demonstrating, demonstrated, demonstration*\n\n**v.** 证明；展示；演示\n\n**例句：** The experiment demonstrates the theory.\n实验证明了这个理论。\n","x":160,"y":5680,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"54","type":"text","text":"observe  [əbˈzɜːv]\n*observing, observed, observation, observant*\n\n**v.** 观察；遵守；注意到\n\n**例句：** I observed him enter the building.\n我看到他进入了大楼。\n","x":760,"y":5680,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"55","type":"text","text":"performance  [pəˈfɔːməns]\n*perform, performing, performed, performer*\n\n**n.** 表演；表现；性能\n\n**例句：** Her performance was excellent.\n她的表演非常出色。\n","x":-440,"y":6020,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"56","type":"text","text":"appeal  [əˈpiːl]\n*appealing, appealed, appealingly*\n\n**v.** 呼吁；吸引；上诉\n**n.** 呼吁；吸引力；上诉\n\n**例句：** The idea appeals to me.\n这个想法对我有吸引力。\n","x":160,"y":6020,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"57","type":"text","text":"consume  [kənˈsjuːm]\n*consuming, consumed, consumption, consumer*\n\n**v.** 消耗；消费；吃；喝\n\n**例句：** We consume a lot of energy every day.\n我们每天消耗大量能源。\n","x":760,"y":6020,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"58","type":"text","text":"consumption  [kənˈsʌmpʃn]\n*consume, consuming, consumed, consumer*\n\n**n.** 消费；消耗；消费量\n\n**例句：** The consumption of oil is increasing.\n石油消费量正在增加。\n","x":-440,"y":6360,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"59","type":"text","text":"fundamental  [ˌfʌndəˈmentl]\n*fundamentally, fund, funding, funded*\n\n**adj.** 基本的；根本的\n**n.** 基本原则；基本原理\n\n**例句：** Hard work is fundamental to success.\n努力工作是成功的基础。\n","x":160,"y":6360,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"60","type":"text","text":"institute  [ˈɪnstɪtjuːt]\n*instituting, instituted, institution, institutional*\n\n**n.** 研究所；学院；协会\n**v.** 建立；制定；开始\n\n**例句：** He works at a research institute.\n他在一家研究所工作。\n","x":760,"y":6360,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"61","type":"text","text":"purchase  [ˈpɜːtʃəs]\n*purchasing, purchased, purchaser*\n\n**v.** 购买；采购\n**n.** 购买；购买的东西\n\n**例句：** I made a purchase at the store.\n我在商店买了东西。\n","x":-440,"y":6700,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"62","type":"text","text":"contrast  [ˈkɒntrɑːst]\n*contrasting, contrasted, contrasting*\n\n**n.** 对比；对照；差异\n**v.** 对比；对照\n\n**例句：** There is a sharp contrast between the two.\n两者之间有明显的对比。\n","x":160,"y":6700,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"63","type":"text","text":"interpret  [ɪnˈtɜːprɪt]\n*interpreting, interpreted, interpretation, interpreter*\n\n**v.** 解释；口译；理解\n\n**例句：** How do you interpret this passage?\n你如何解释这段话？\n","x":760,"y":6700,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"64","type":"text","text":"widespread  [ˈwaɪdspred]\n*wide, widely, spread, spreading*\n\n**adj.** 广泛的；普遍的\n\n**例句：** There is widespread concern about the issue.\n人们对这个问题普遍关注。\n","x":-440,"y":7040,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"65","type":"text","text":"boost  [buːst]\n*boosting, boosted*\n\n**v.** 促进；增加；提升\n**n.** 促进；增加；提升\n\n**例句：** The new policy will boost the economy.\n新政策将促进经济发展。\n","x":160,"y":7040,"width":565,"height":300},
