		{"id":"67","type":"text","text":"option  [ˈɒpʃn]\n*optional, optionally, opt, opting*\n\n**n.** 选择；选项；选择权\n\n**例句：** We have several options to consider.\n我们有几个选项要考虑。\n","x":-440,"y":7380,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"68","type":"text","text":"adjust  [əˈdʒʌst]\n*adjusting, adjusted, adjustment*\n\n**v.** 调整；适应；校准\n\n**例句：** I need to adjust my schedule.\n我需要调整我的日程安排。\n","x":160,"y":7380,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"69","type":"text","text":"attitude  [ˈætɪtjuːd]\n*attitudinal*\n\n**n.** 态度；看法；姿势\n\n**例句：** She has a positive attitude towards life.\n她对生活持积极态度。\n","x":760,"y":7380,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"70","type":"text","text":"strength  [streŋθ]\n*strong, strongly, strengthen*\n\n**n.** 力量；体力；强度；优势\n\n**例句：** Knowledge is strength.\n知识就是力量。\n","x":-440,"y":7720,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"71","type":"text","text":"overall  [ˈəʊvərɔːl]\n*over, all, overalls*\n\n**adj.** 全面的；总体的；全部的\n**adv.** 总的来说；全面地\n\n**例句：** The overall situation is good.\n总体情况是好的。\n","x":160,"y":7720,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"72","type":"text","text":"advocate  [ˈædvəkeɪt]\n*advocating, advocated, advocacy*\n\n**v.** 提倡；主张；拥护\n**n.** 倡导者；支持者\n\n**例句：** He advocates for environmental protection.\n他提倡环境保护。\n","x":760,"y":7720,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"73","type":"text","text":"afford  [əˈfɔːd]\n*affording, afforded, affordable*\n\n**v.** 买得起；负担得起；提供\n\n**例句：** I can't afford that expensive car.\n我买不起那辆昂贵的汽车。\n","x":-440,"y":8060,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"74","type":"text","text":"crucial  [ˈkruːʃl]\n*crucially*\n\n**adj.** 至关重要的；决定性的\n\n**例句：** This is a crucial decision.\n这是一个至关重要的决定。\n","x":160,"y":8060,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"75","type":"text","text":"justice  [ˈdʒʌstɪs]\n*just, justly, justify, justification*\n\n**n.** 正义；公正；司法\n\n**例句：** We should fight for justice.\n我们应该为正义而战。\n","x":760,"y":8060,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"76","type":"text","text":"agency  [ˈeɪdʒənsi]\n*agent, agency, agential*\n\n**n.** 机构；代理；中介\n\n**例句：** She works for a travel agency.\n她在一家旅行社工作。\n","x":-440,"y":8400,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"77","type":"text","text":"variety  [vəˈraɪəti]\n*various, variously, vary, varying*\n\n**n.** 多样性；种类；变化\n\n**例句：** There is a wide variety of products.\n有各种各样的产品。\n","x":160,"y":8400,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"78","type":"text","text":"positive  [ˈpɒzətɪv]\n*positively, positivity, positive*\n\n**adj.** 积极的；肯定的；正面的\n**n.** 正数；阳性\n\n**例句：** She has a positive outlook on life.\n她对生活有积极的看法。\n","x":760,"y":8400,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"79","type":"text","text":"scale  [skeɪl]\n*scaling, scaled*\n\n**n.** 规模；比例；尺度；音阶\n**v.** 缩放；攀登\n\n**例句：** The project is on a large scale.\n这个项目规模很大。\n","x":-440,"y":8740,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"80","type":"text","text":"reflect  [rɪˈflekt]\n*reflecting, reflected, reflection, reflective*\n\n**v.** 反映；反射；思考\n**n.** 反射；反映\n\n**例句：** The mirror reflects light.\n镜子反射光线。\n","x":160,"y":8740,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"81","type":"text","text":"estimate  [ˈestɪmət]\n*estimating, estimated, estimation*\n\n**v.** 估计；评估；判断\n**n.** 估计；评估；判断\n\n**例句：** I estimate the cost to be around $100.\n我估计费用约为100美元。\n","x":760,"y":8740,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"82","type":"text","text":"balance  [ˈbæləns]\n*balancing, balanced, unbalanced*\n\n**n.** 平衡；天平；余额\n**v.** 平衡；权衡；结算\n\n**例句：** We need to balance work and life.\n我们需要平衡工作和生活。\n","x":-440,"y":9080,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"83","type":"text","text":"colleague  [ˈkɒliːɡ]\n*collegial, collegially*\n\n**n.** 同事；同僚\n\n**例句：** She is a good colleague.\n她是一个好同事。\n","x":160,"y":9080,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"84","type":"text","text":"regard  [rɪˈɡɑːd]\n*regarding, regarded, regardless*\n\n**v.** 认为；看待；注视\n**n.** 尊重；关注；方面\n\n**例句：** I regard him as my friend.\n我把他当作朋友。\n","x":760,"y":9080,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"85","type":"text","text":"practical  [ˈpræktɪkl]\n*practically, practice, practise*\n\n**adj.** 实际的；实用的；实践的\n\n**例句：** This is a practical solution.\n这是一个实际的解决方案。\n","x":-440,"y":9420,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"86","type":"text","text":"scholar  [ˈskɒlə(r)]\n*scholarly, scholarship, school*\n\n**n.** 学者；奖学金获得者\n\n**例句：** He is a famous scholar in his field.\n他是该领域的著名学者。\n","x":160,"y":9420,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"87","type":"text","text":"congress  [ˈkɒŋɡres]\n*congressional, congressman, congresswoman*\n\n**n.** 国会；代表大会；会议\n\n**例句：** The Congress will meet next week.\n国会下周将开会。\n","x":760,"y":9420,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"88","type":"text","text":"alter  [ˈɔːltə(r)]\n*altering, altered, alteration*\n\n**v.** 改变；修改；变更\n\n**例句：** I need to alter my plans.\n我需要改变我的计划。\n","x":-440,"y":9760,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"89","type":"text","text":"release  [rɪˈliːs]\n*releasing, released*\n\n**v.** 释放；发布；发行\n**n.** 释放；发布；发行\n\n**例句：** The company will release a new product next month.\n公司下个月将发布一款新产品。\n","x":160,"y":9760,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"90","type":"text","text":"comment  [ˈkɒment]\n*commenting, commented, commentary*\n\n**v.** 评论；注释\n**n.** 评论；意见；注释\n\n**例句：** He made a comment on the issue.\n他对这个问题发表了评论。\n","x":760,"y":9760,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"91","type":"text","text":"commit  [kəˈmɪt]\n*committing, committed, commitment*\n\n**v.** 承诺；犯（罪）；委托\n\n**例句：** He committed to helping us.\n他承诺帮助我们。\n","x":-440,"y":10100,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"92","type":"text","text":"basis  [ˈbeɪsɪs]\n*base, basic, basically*\n\n**n.** 基础；根据；基准\n\n**例句：** We need to build on a solid basis.\n我们需要在坚实的基础上建设。\n","x":160,"y":10100,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"93","type":"text","text":"except  [ɪkˈsept]\n*excepting, exception, exceptional*\n\n**prep.** 除了；除...之外\n**conj.** 除非；除了\n\n**例句：** Everyone was present except him.\n除了他，所有人都在场。\n","x":760,"y":10100,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"94","type":"text","text":"debate  [dɪˈbeɪt]\n*debating, debated, debatable*\n\n**n.** 辩论；讨论\n**v.** 辩论；讨论\n\n**例句：** There was a heated debate on the topic.\n关于这个话题有一场激烈的辩论。\n","x":-440,"y":10440,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"95","type":"text","text":"industrial  [ɪnˈdʌstriəl]\n*industrially, industry, industrialize*\n\n**adj.** 工业的；产业的；工业发达的\n\n**例句：** The country has a strong industrial base.\n这个国家有强大的工业基础。\n","x":160,"y":10440,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"96","type":"text","text":"survive  [səˈvaɪv]\n*surviving, survived, survival, survivor*\n\n**v.** 生存；存活；幸存\n\n**例句：** He survived the accident.\n他在事故中幸存下来。\n","x":760,"y":10440,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"97","type":"text","text":"primary  [ˈpraɪməri]\n*primarily, prime, primitive*\n\n**adj.** 主要的；初级的；基本的\n**n.** -primary school 小学\n\n**例句：** The primary cause of the problem is lack of communication.\n问题的主要原因是缺乏沟通。\n","x":-440,"y":10780,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"98","type":"text","text":"merely  [ˈmɪəli]\n*mere*\n\n**adv.** 仅仅；只不过\n\n**例句：** He is merely a child.\n他仅仅是个孩子。\n","x":160,"y":10780,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"99","type":"text","text":"species  [ˈspiːʃiːz]\n*specie*\n\n**n.** 物种；种类\n\n**例句：** There are many species of animals in the forest.\n森林里有许多种类的动物。\n","x":760,"y":10780,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"100","type":"text","text":"propose  [prəˈpəʊz]\n*proposing, proposed, proposal, proposition*\n\n**v.** 提议；建议；求婚\n\n**例句：** He proposed a new plan.\n他提出了一个新计划。\n","x":-440,"y":11120,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"101","type":"text","text":"consist  [kənˈsɪst]\n*consisting, consistent, consistency*\n\n**v.** 组成；构成；存在于\n\n**例句：** The team consists of five members.\n这个团队由五名成员组成。\n","x":160,"y":11120,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"102","type":"text","text":"democratic  [ˌdeməˈkrætɪk]\n*democratically, democracy, democrat*\n\n**adj.** 民主的；民主政体的\n\n**例句：** We live in a democratic society.\n我们生活在一个民主社会中。\n","x":760,"y":11120,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"103","type":"text","text":"obtain  [əbˈteɪn]\n*obtaining, obtained, obtainable*\n\n**v.** 获得；得到；买到\n\n**例句：** He obtained a degree from the university.\n他从大学获得了学位。\n","x":-440,"y":11460,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"104","type":"text","text":"shape  [ʃeɪp]\n*shaping, shaped, shapeless*\n\n**n.** 形状；形态；外形\n**v.** 塑造；形成；使成形\n\n**例句：** The moon has a round shape.\n月亮是圆形的。\n","x":160,"y":11460,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"105","type":"text","text":"contain  [kənˈteɪn]\n*containing, contained, container, containment*\n\n**v.** 包含；容纳；控制\n\n**例句：** The box contains books.\n这个盒子里装着书。\n","x":760,"y":11460,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"106","type":"text","text":"instance  [ˈɪnstəns]\n*instant, instantly, instantaneous*\n\n**n.** 实例；例子；情况\n\n**例句：** For instance, he is a good student.\n例如，他是一个好学生。\n","x":-440,"y":11800,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"107","type":"text","text":"depress  [dɪˈpres]\n*depressing, depressed, depression, depressive*\n\n**v.** 使沮丧；使抑郁；压低\n\n**例句：** The bad news depressed him.\n坏消息使他沮丧。\n","x":160,"y":11800,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"108","type":"text","text":"publication  [ˌpʌblɪˈkeɪʃn]\n*publish, publishing, published, public*\n\n**n.** 出版；发行；出版物\n\n**例句：** The book will be ready for publication next month.\n这本书下个月将准备出版。\n","x":760,"y":11800,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"109","type":"text","text":"revenue  [ˈrevənjuː]\n*revenue, revenues*\n\n**n.** 收入；税收；收益\n\n**例句：** The company's revenue increased last year.\n公司去年的收入增加了。\n","x":-440,"y":12140,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"110","type":"text","text":"intelligence  [ɪnˈtelɪdʒəns]\n*intelligent, intelligently, intellect*\n\n**n.** 智力；智慧；情报\n\n**例句：** He has high intelligence.\n他有很高的智力。\n","x":160,"y":12140,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"111","type":"text","text":"revolution  [ˌrevəˈluːʃn]\n*revolve, revolving, revolved, revolutionary*\n\n**n.** 革命；彻底变革；旋转\n\n**例句：** The Industrial Revolution changed the world.\n工业革命改变了世界。\n","x":760,"y":12140,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"112","type":"text","text":"argument  [ˈɑːɡjumənt]\n*argue, arguing, argued, arguable*\n\n**n.** 争论；论点；论据\n\n**例句：** They had an argument about the issue.\n他们就这个问题进行了争论。\n","x":-440,"y":12480,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"113","type":"text","text":"interact  [ˌɪntərˈækt]\n*interacting, interacted, interaction, interactive*\n\n**v.** 相互作用；相互影响；互动\n\n**例句：** People interact with each other in various ways.\n人们以各种方式相互交流。\n","x":160,"y":12480,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"114","type":"text","text":"generate  [ˈdʒenəreɪt]\n*generating, generated, generation, generator*\n\n**v.** 产生；生成；引起\n\n**例句：** The machine generates electricity.\n这台机器发电。\n","x":760,"y":12480,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"115","type":"text","text":"corporation  [ˌkɔːpəˈreɪʃn]\n*corporate, corporately, incorporate*\n\n**n.** 公司；法人；企业\n\n**例句：** He works for a large corporation.\n他在一家大公司工作。\n","x":-440,"y":12820,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"116","type":"text","text":"assess  [əˈses]\n*assessing, assessed, assessment*\n\n**v.** 评估；评定；估价\n\n**例句：** We need to assess the situation.\n我们需要评估形势。\n","x":160,"y":12820,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"117","type":"text","text":"association  [əˌsəʊsiˈeɪʃn]\n*associate, associating, associated, associative*\n\n**n.** 协会；关联；联想\n\n**例句：** He is a member of the association.\n他是该协会的成员。\n","x":760,"y":12820,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"118","type":"text","text":"brand  [brænd]\n*branding, branded, brandish*\n\n**n.** 品牌；商标\n**v.** 打烙印；加商标于\n\n**例句：** This is a well-known brand.\n这是一个知名品牌。\n","x":-440,"y":13160,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"119","type":"text","text":"humanity  [hjuːˈmænəti]\n*human, humane, humanely, humanitarian*\n\n**n.** 人类；人道；仁慈\n\n**例句：** We should care for humanity.\n我们应该关心人类。\n","x":160,"y":13160,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"120","type":"text","text":"therefore  [ˈðeəfɔː(r)]\n*there, fore*\n\n**adv.** 因此；所以\n**conj.** 因此；所以\n\n**例句：** He was ill, therefore he didn't come.\n他生病了，所以没来。\n","x":760,"y":13160,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"121","type":"text","text":"advantage  [ədˈvɑːntɪdʒ]\n*advantageous, advantageously, disadvantage*\n\n**n.** 优势；有利条件；优点\n**v.** 有利于；使处于优势\n\n**例句：** He has an advantage over others.\n他比其他人有优势。\n","x":-440,"y":13500,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"122","type":"text","text":"politics  [ˈpɒlətɪks]\n*political, politically, politician*\n\n**n.** 政治；政治学；政治活动\n\n**例句：** He is interested in politics.\n他对政治感兴趣。\n","x":160,"y":13500,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"123","type":"text","text":"critic  [ˈkrɪtɪk]\n*critical, critically, criticism, criticize*\n\n**n.** 批评家；评论家；挑剔的人\n\n**例句：** The critic reviewed the movie.\n评论家评论了这部电影。\n","x":760,"y":13500,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"124","type":"text","text":"threat  [θret]\n*threatening, threatened, threateningly*\n\n**n.** 威胁；恐吓；凶兆\n**v.** 威胁；恐吓\n\n**例句：** There is a threat of war.\n有战争的威胁。\n","x":-440,"y":13840,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"125","type":"text","text":"grant  [ɡrɑːnt]\n*granting, granted*\n\n**v.** 授予；给予；承认\n**n.** 授予；补助金；拨款\n\n**例句：** The government granted him a scholarship.\n政府授予他奖学金。\n","x":160,"y":13840,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"126","type":"text","text":"ignore  [ɪɡˈnɔː(r)]\n*ignoring, ignored, ignorance, ignorant*\n\n**v.** 忽视；忽略；不理睬\n\n**例句：** Don't ignore the problem.\n不要忽视这个问题。\n","x":760,"y":13840,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"127","type":"text","text":"suffer  [ˈsʌfə(r)]\n*suffering, suffered, suffering*\n\n**v.** 遭受；忍受；经历\n\n**例句：** He suffered from a disease.\n他患了一种疾病。\n","x":-440,"y":14180,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"128","type":"text","text":"confuse  [kənˈfjuːz]\n*confusing, confused, confusion, confusingly*\n\n**v.** 使困惑；使混乱；混淆\n\n**例句：** The question confused me.\n这个问题使我困惑。\n","x":160,"y":14180,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"129","type":"text","text":"reject  [rɪˈdʒekt]\n*rejecting, rejected, rejection*\n\n**v.** 拒绝；驳回；排斥\n**n.** 拒绝；驳回；被拒之物\n\n**例句：** He rejected the offer.\n他拒绝了这个提议。\n","x":760,"y":14180,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"130","type":"text","text":"conscious  [ˈkɒnʃəs]\n*consciously, consciousness, unconscious*\n\n**adj.** 有意识的；自觉的；清醒的\n\n**例句：** He was conscious of his mistake.\n他意识到了自己的错误。\n","x":-440,"y":14520,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"131","type":"text","text":"capacity  [kəˈpæsəti]\n*capable, capably, capacious*\n\n**n.** 能力；容量；资格\n\n**例句：** He has the capacity to do the job.\n他有能力做这项工作。\n","x":160,"y":14520,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"132","type":"text","text":"remove  [rɪˈmuːv]\n*removing, removed, removal*\n\n**v.** 移除；删除；消除\n**n.** 移除；删除；消除\n\n**例句：** Please remove the trash.\n请把垃圾拿走。\n","x":760,"y":14520,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"133","type":"text","text":"path  [pɑːθ]\n*pathway, pathless*\n\n**n.** 路径；小路；轨道\n\n**例句：** We walked along the path.\n我们沿着小路走。\n","x":-440,"y":14860,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"134","type":"text","text":"track  [træk]\n*tracking, tracked, trackable*\n\n**n.** 轨道；跑道；跟踪\n**v.** 跟踪；追踪；留下足迹\n\n**例句：** The train runs on the track.\n火车在轨道上行驶。\n","x":160,"y":14860,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"135","type":"text","text":"competition  [ˌkɒmpəˈtɪʃn]\n*compete, competing, competed, competitive*\n\n**n.** 竞争；比赛；竞赛\n\n**例句：** There is fierce competition in the market.\n市场上竞争激烈。\n","x":760,"y":14860,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"136","type":"text","text":"sustain  [səˈsteɪn]\n*sustaining, sustained, sustainable, sustainability*\n\n**v.** 维持；支撑；持续\n\n**例句：** We need to sustain our efforts.\n我们需要维持我们的努力。\n","x":-440,"y":15200,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"137","type":"text","text":"progress  [ˈprəʊɡres]\n*progressing, progressed, progressive*\n\n**n.** 进步；进展；发展\n**v.** 进步；进展；发展\n\n**例句：** We have made great progress.\n我们取得了很大的进步。\n","x":160,"y":15200,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"138","type":"text","text":"represent  [ˌreprɪˈzent]\n*representing, represented, representation, representative*\n\n**v.** 代表；表示；象征\n\n**例句：** He represents the company.\n他代表公司。\n","x":760,"y":15200,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"139","type":"text","text":"transform  [trænsˈfɔːm]\n*transforming, transformed, transformation, transformative*\n\n**v.** 改变；转换；变形\n\n**例句：** The Internet has transformed our lives.\n互联网已经改变了我们的生活。\n","x":-440,"y":15540,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"140","type":"text","text":"separate  [ˈseprət]\n*separating, separated, separation, separator*\n\n**adj.** 分开的；单独的；独立的\n**v.** 分开；分离；隔离\n\n**例句：** They live in separate rooms.\n他们住在分开的房间里。\n","x":160,"y":15540,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"141","type":"text","text":"annual  [ˈænjuəl]\n*annually, annum*\n\n**adj.** 每年的；年度的\n**n.** 年刊；年鉴\n\n**例句：** We have an annual meeting.\n我们有年度会议。\n","x":760,"y":15540,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"142","type":"text","text":"construct  [kənˈstrʌkt]\n*constructing, constructed, construction, constructive*\n\n**v.** 建造；构建；创立\n**n.** 构想；概念\n\n**例句：** They constructed a new building.\n他们建造了一座新建筑。\n","x":-440,"y":15880,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"143","type":"text","text":"department  [dɪˈpɑːtmənt]\n*depart, departing, departed*\n\n**n.** 部门；系；学部\n\n**例句：** He works in the sales department.\n他在销售部门工作。\n","x":160,"y":15880,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"144","type":"text","text":"institution  [ˌɪnstɪˈtjuːʃn]\n*institute, instituting, instituted, institutional*\n\n**n.** 机构；制度；创立\n\n**例句：** The university is a prestigious institution.\n这所大学是一所 prestigious institution.\n这所大学是一所 prestigious institution.\n这所大学是一所著名的机构。\n","x":760,"y":15880,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"145","type":"text","text":"contribute  [kənˈtrɪbjuːt]\n*contributing, contributed, contribution, contributor*\n\n**v.** 贡献；捐献；有助于\n\n**例句：** He contributed to the project.\n他为这个项目做出了贡献。\n","x":-440,"y":16220,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"146","type":"text","text":"intellectual  [ˌɪntəˈlektʃuəl]\n*intellectually, intellect, intelligence*\n\n**adj.** 智力的；知识的；理性的\n**n.** 知识分子；脑力劳动者\n\n**例句：** He is an intellectual person.\n他是一个知识分子。\n","x":160,"y":16220,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"147","type":"text","text":"gap  [ɡæp]\n*gaping, gapped*\n\n**n.** 缺口；差距；间隙\n**v.** 裂开；有缺口\n\n**例句：** There is a gap between rich and poor.\n贫富之间存在差距。\n","x":760,"y":16220,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"148","type":"text","text":"reward  [rɪˈwɔːd]\n*rewarding, rewarded, rewarding*\n\n**n.** 奖励；报酬；回报\n**v.** 奖励；酬谢；报答\n\n**例句：** He received a reward for his hard work.\n他因努力工作而获得奖励。\n","x":-440,"y":16560,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"149","type":"text","text":"convince  [kənˈvɪns]\n*convincing, convinced, convincingness, conviction*\n\n**v.** 说服；使确信；使信服\n\n**例句：** I convinced him to come.\n我说服他来了。\n","x":160,"y":16560,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"150","type":"text","text":"detail  [ˈdiːteɪl]\n*detailing, detailed, detailed*\n\n**n.** 细节；详情；明细\n**v.** 详述；详细说明\n\n**例句：** Please give me the details.\n请给我详细信息。\n","x":760,"y":16560,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"151","type":"text","text":"board  [bɔːd]\n*boarding, boarded, boarder*\n\n**n.** 板；木板；董事会\n**v.** 上（船、车、飞机）\n\n**例句：** The board meeting will be held tomorrow.\n董事会会议将于明天举行。\n","x":-440,"y":16900,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"152","type":"text","text":"access  [ˈækses]\n*accessing, accessed, accessible, accessibility*\n\n**n.** 进入；通道；使用权\n**v.** 访问；进入；获取\n\n**例句：** We have access to the library.\n我们可以进入图书馆。\n","x":160,"y":16900,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"153","type":"text","text":"status  [ˈsteɪtəs]\n*state, stately, statement*\n\n**n.** 状态；地位；身份\n\n**例句：** He has a high status in society.\n他在社会上有很高的地位。\n","x":760,"y":16900,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"154","type":"text","text":"investment  [ɪnˈvestmənt]\n*invest, investing, invested, investor*\n\n**n.** 投资；投入；投资额\n\n**例句：** He made an investment in the company.\n他在公司进行了投资。\n","x":-440,"y":17240,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"155","type":"text","text":"digital  [ˈdɪdʒɪtl]\n*digitally, digit, digitalize*\n\n**adj.** 数字的；数码的；数字式的\n\n**例句：** We live in a digital age.\n我们生活在数字时代。\n","x":160,"y":17240,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"156","type":"text","text":"stock  [stɒk]\n*stocking, stocked, stockpile*\n\n**n.** 库存；股票；储备\n**v.** 储备；储存；备货\n\n**例句：** He bought stocks in the company.\n他购买了公司的股票。\n","x":760,"y":17240,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"157","type":"text","text":"unique  [juˈniːk]\n*uniquely, uniqueness*\n\n**adj.** 独特的；唯一的；独一无二的\n\n**例句：** She has a unique style.\n她有独特的风格。\n","x":-440,"y":17580,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"158","type":"text","text":"strategy  [ˈstrætədʒi]\n*strategic, strategically, strategist*\n\n**n.** 战略；策略；计谋\n\n**例句：** We need a new strategy.\n我们需要一个新策略。\n","x":160,"y":17580,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"159","type":"text","text":"advance  [ədˈvɑːns]\n*advancing, advanced, advancement, advanced*\n\n**n.** 前进；进步；预先\n**v.** 前进；进展；提前\n**adj.** 预先的；事先的\n\n**例句：** We made great advances in science.\n我们在科学上取得了巨大进步。\n","x":760,"y":17580,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"160","type":"text","text":"crisis  [ˈkraɪsɪs]\n*crises, critical, critically*\n\n**n.** 危机；危急关头；紧要关头\n\n**例句：** The country is facing an economic crisis.\n该国正面临经济危机。\n","x":-440,"y":17920,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"161","type":"text","text":"majority  [məˈdʒɒrəti]\n*major, majorly, minority*\n\n**n.** 多数；大多数；过半数\n\n**例句：** The majority of people agree with the plan.\n大多数人同意这个计划。\n","x":160,"y":17920,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"162","type":"text","text":"management  [ˈmænɪdʒmənt]\n*manage, managing, managed, manager*\n\n**n.** 管理；经营；管理层\n\n**例句：** The company has good management.\n公司管理良好。\n","x":760,"y":17920,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"163","type":"text","text":"succeed  [səkˈsiːd]\n*succeeding, succeeded, success, successful*\n\n**v.** 成功；继承；接替\n\n**例句：** He succeeded in his business.\n他在事业上取得了成功。\n","x":-440,"y":18260,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"164","type":"text","text":"conclude  [kənˈkluːd]\n*concluding, concluded, conclusion, conclusive*\n\n**v.** 结束；推断；决定\n**n.** 结论；结束\n\n**例句：** We concluded the meeting at 5 PM.\n我们在下午5点结束了会议。\n","x":160,"y":18260,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"165","type":"text","text":"establish  [ɪˈstæblɪʃ]\n*establishing, established, establishment*\n\n**v.** 建立；创立；确立\n\n**例句：** They established a company.\n他们建立了一家公司。\n","x":760,"y":18260,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"166","type":"text","text":"mark  [mɑːk]\n*marking, marked, marker*\n\n**n.** 标记；符号；痕迹\n**v.** 标记；做记号；标明\n\n**例句：** He made a mark on the wall.\n他在墙上做了个标记。\n","x":-440,"y":18600,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"167","type":"text","text":"divide  [dɪˈvaɪd]\n*dividing, divided, division, divisive*\n\n**v.** 分开；分割；划分\n**n.** 分开；分割；分水岭\n\n**例句：** The river divides the city.\n这条河把城市分开。\n","x":160,"y":18600,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"168","type":"text","text":"eventually  [ɪˈventʃuəli]\n*eventual, eventually*\n\n**adv.** 最终；终于\n\n**例句：** He eventually succeeded.\n他最终成功了。\n","x":760,"y":18600,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"169","type":"text","text":"material  [məˈtɪəriəl]\n*materially, materialism, materialist*\n\n**n.** 材料；物质；素材\n**adj.** 物质的；重要的；实质性的\n\n**例句：** We need more materials.\n我们需要更多材料。\n","x":-440,"y":18940,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"170","type":"text","text":"rely  [rɪˈlaɪ]\n*relying, relied, reliance, reliable*\n\n**v.** 依靠；依赖；信赖\n\n**例句：** We can rely on him.\n我们可以依靠他。\n","x":160,"y":18940,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"171","type":"text","text":"remains  [rɪˈmeɪnz]\n*remain, remaining, remained*\n\n**v.** 保持；仍然是；剩余\n**n.** 剩余物；遗迹；遗体\n\n**例句：** The problem remains unsolved.\n这个问题仍然未解决。\n","x":760,"y":18940,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"172","type":"text","text":"debt  [det]\n*debtor, indebted*\n\n**n.** 债务；欠款；义务\n\n**例句：** He is in debt.\n他负债。\n","x":-440,"y":19280,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"173","type":"text","text":"supreme  [suːˈpriːm]\n*supremely, supremacy*\n\n**adj.** 最高的；至上的；极度的\n\n**例句：** The Supreme Court is the highest court.\n最高法院是最高级别的法院。\n","x":160,"y":19280,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"174","type":"text","text":"inevitable  [ɪnˈevɪtəbl]\n*inevitably, inevitability*\n\n**adj.** 不可避免的；必然的\n\n**例句：** Change is inevitable.\n变化是不可避免的。\n","x":760,"y":19280,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"175","type":"text","text":"prevent  [prɪˈvent]\n*preventing, prevented, prevention, preventive*\n\n**v.** 预防；防止；阻止\n\n**例句：** We need to prevent accidents.\n我们需要预防事故。\n","x":-440,"y":19620,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"176","type":"text","text":"survey  [ˈsɜːveɪ]\n*surveying, surveyed, surveyor*\n\n**n.** 调查；测量；审视\n**v.** 调查；测量；审视\n\n**例句：** We conducted a survey.\n我们进行了一项调查。\n","x":160,"y":19620,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"177","type":"text","text":"mental  [ˈmentl]\n*mentally, mind, mentalist*\n\n**adj.** 精神的；心理的；智力的\n\n**例句：** He has mental health issues.\n他有心理健康问题。\n","x":760,"y":19620,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"178","type":"text","text":"replace  [rɪˈpleɪs]\n*replacing, replaced, replacement*\n\n**v.** 替换；取代；更换\n\n**例句：** He replaced the old car with a new one.\n他用新车替换了旧车。\n","x":-440,"y":19960,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"179","type":"text","text":"principle  [ˈprɪnsəpl]\n*principal, principally*\n\n**n.** 原则；原理；准则\n\n**例句：** We should follow the principles of democracy.\n我们应该遵循民主原则。\n","x":160,"y":19960,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"180","type":"text","text":"promise  [ˈprɒmɪs]\n*promising, promised, promisingly*\n\n**v.** 承诺；答应；预示\n**n.** 承诺；诺言；希望\n\n**例句：** He made a promise to help us.\n他承诺帮助我们。\n","x":760,"y":19960,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"181","type":"text","text":"series  [ˈsɪəriːz]\n*serial, serially, serialize*\n\n**n.** 系列；连续；丛书\n\n**例句：** We watched a series of movies.\n我们看了一系列电影。\n","x":-440,"y":20300,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"182","type":"text","text":"frequent  [ˈfriːkwənt]\n*frequently, frequency*\n\n**adj.** 频繁的；经常的\n**adv.** 频繁地；经常地\n\n**例句：** He makes frequent visits to the library.\n他经常去图书馆。\n","x":160,"y":20300,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"183","type":"text","text":"warn  [wɔːn]\n*warning, warned, warningly*\n\n**v.** 警告；告诫；提醒\n**n.** 警告；告诫\n\n**例句：** The weather forecast warned of rain.\n天气预报警告有雨。\n","x":760,"y":20300,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"184","type":"text","text":"prospect  [ˈprɒspekt]\n*prospective, prospectively, prospecting*\n\n**n.** 前景；展望；可能性\n**v.** 勘探；探矿\n\n**例句：** The job has good prospects.\n这份工作有很好的前景。\n","x":-440,"y":20640,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"185","type":"text","text":"resource  [rɪˈsɔːs]\n*resourceful, resourcefully, resources*\n\n**n.** 资源；财力；办法\n\n**例句：** We need to conserve natural resources.\n我们需要保护自然资源。\n","x":160,"y":20640,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"186","type":"text","text":"insist  [ɪnˈsɪst]\n*insisting, insisted, insistence, insistent*\n\n**v.** 坚持；坚决要求；固执己见\n\n**例句：** He insisted on going alone.\n他坚持要一个人去。\n","x":760,"y":20640,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"187","type":"text","text":"profit  [ˈprɒfɪt]\n*profiting, profited, profitable, profitability*\n\n**n.** 利润；收益；益处\n**v.** 获利；盈利；有益于\n\n**例句：** The company made a profit last year.\n公司去年盈利了。\n","x":-440,"y":20980,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"188","type":"text","text":"respond  [rɪˈspɒnd]\n*responding, responded, response, responsive*\n\n**v.** 回应；回答；响应\n\n**例句：** He responded to my question.\n他回答了我的问题。\n","x":160,"y":20980,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"189","type":"text","text":"character  [ˈkærəktə(r)]\n*characteristic, characteristically, characterize*\n\n**n.** 性格；角色；字符\n**v.** 刻；印\n\n**例句：** He has a strong character.\n他性格坚强。\n","x":760,"y":20980,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"190","type":"text","text":"official  [əˈfɪʃl]\n*officially, office, officer*\n\n**adj.** 官方的；正式的；公务的\n**n.** 官员；公务员\n\n**例句：** The official announcement was made yesterday.\n官方公告是昨天发布的。\n","x":-440,"y":21320,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"191","type":"text","text":"review  [rɪˈvjuː]\n*reviewing, reviewed, reviewer*\n\n**v.** 复习；回顾；审查\n**n.** 复习；回顾；审查\n\n**例句：** We need to review the lesson.\n我们需要复习这节课。\n","x":160,"y":21320,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"192","type":"text","text":"phenomenon  [fəˈnɒmɪnən]\n*phenomena, phenomenal, phenomenally*\n\n**n.** 现象；奇迹；杰出的人\n\n**例句：** The phenomenon is difficult to explain.\n这种现象很难解释。\n","x":760,"y":21320,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"193","type":"text","text":"link  [lɪŋk]\n*linking, linked, linkage*\n\n**v.** 连接；联系；链接\n**n.** 连接；联系；链接\n\n**例句：** The bridge links the two cities.\n这座桥连接了两个城市。\n","x":-440,"y":21660,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"194","type":"text","text":"chief  [tʃiːf]\n*chiefly*\n\n**adj.** 主要的；首席的；首领的\n**n.** 首领；酋长；长官\n\n**例句：** He is the chief executive officer.\n他是首席执行官。\n","x":160,"y":21660,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"195","type":"text","text":"aspect  [ˈæspekt]\n*aspects*\n\n**n.** 方面；层面；外观\n\n**例句：** We need to consider all aspects of the problem.\n我们需要考虑问题的所有方面。\n","x":760,"y":21660,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"196","type":"text","text":"moral  [ˈmɒrəl]\n*morally, morality, immoral*\n\n**adj.** 道德的；道义的；精神上的\n**n.** 道德；品行；寓意\n\n**例句：** We should have high moral standards.\n我们应该有高道德标准。\n","x":-440,"y":22000,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"197","type":"text","text":"acknowledge  [əkˈnɒlɪdʒ]\n*acknowledging, acknowledged, acknowledgment*\n\n**v.** 承认；感谢；确认\n\n**例句：** He acknowledged his mistake.\n他承认了自己的错误。\n","x":160,"y":22000,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"198","type":"text","text":"similar  [ˈsɪmɪlə(r)]\n*similarly, similarity, dissimilar*\n\n**adj.** 相似的；类似的\n**n.** 类似物\n\n**例句：** The two cars are similar.\n这两辆车很相似。\n","x":760,"y":22000,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"199","type":"text","text":"feature  [ˈfiːtʃə(r)]\n*featuring, featured, featuring*\n\n**n.** 特征；特点；特色\n**v.** 以...为特色；特写\n\n**例句：** The hotel features a swimming pool.\n这家酒店以游泳池为特色。\n","x":-440,"y":22340,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"200","type":"text","text":"broad  [brɔːd]\n*broadly, breadth, broaden*\n\n**adj.** 宽阔的；广泛的；概括的\n\n**例句：** He has a broad knowledge.\n他知识渊博。\n","x":160,"y":22340,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"201","type":"text","text":"discover  [dɪˈskʌvə(r)]\n*discovering, discovered, discovery, discoverer*\n\n**v.** 发现；发觉；找到\n\n**例句：** Columbus discovered America.\n哥伦布发现了美洲。\n","x":760,"y":22340,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"202","type":"text","text":"graduate  [ˈɡrædʒuət]\n*graduating, graduated, graduation, undergraduate*\n\n**v.** 毕业；获得学位\n**n.** 毕业生\n**adj.** 毕业的；研究生的\n\n**例句：** She graduated from university last year.\n她去年大学毕业。\n","x":-440,"y":22680,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"203","type":"text","text":"maintain  [meɪnˈteɪn]\n*maintaining, maintained, maintenance*\n\n**v.** 维持；保持；维修\n\n**例句：** We need to maintain the equipment.\n我们需要维护设备。\n","x":160,"y":22680,"width":565,"height":300},
