		{"id":"207","type":"text","text":"negative  [ˈneɡətɪv]\n*negatively, negation, positive*\n\n**adj.** 消极的；否定的；负的\n**n.** 否定；负数；底片\n\n**例句：** Don't be negative about everything.\n不要对一切都持消极态度。\n","x":760,"y":23020,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"208","type":"text","text":"labor  [ˈleɪbə(r)]\n*laboring, labored, laborer, laborious*\n\n**n.** 劳动；工作；劳工\n**v.** 劳动；苦干\n\n**例句：** Labor is the source of all wealth.\n劳动是一切财富的源泉。\n","x":-440,"y":23360,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"209","type":"text","text":"relate  [rɪˈleɪt]\n*relating, related, relation, relationship*\n\n**v.** 联系；关联；讲述\n\n**例句：** The two events are related.\n这两个事件有关联。\n","x":160,"y":23360,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"210","type":"text","text":"campaign  [kæmˈpeɪn]\n*campaigning, campaigned*\n\n**n.** 运动；活动；战役\n**v.** 参加运动；从事活动\n\n**例句：** They launched a campaign to protect the environment.\n他们发起了一项保护环境的运动。\n","x":760,"y":23360,"width":565,"height":300},
