		{"id":"212","type":"text","text":"analysis  [əˈnæləsɪs]\n*analyze, analyzing, analyzed, analytical*\n\n**n.** 分析；解析；分解\n\n**例句：** We need to do an analysis of the data.\n我们需要对数据进行分析。\n","x":160,"y":23700,"width":565,"height":300},
