		{"id":"216","type":"text","text":"extend  [ɪkˈstend]\n*extending, extended, extension, extensive*\n\n**v.** 延长；扩展；延伸\n\n**例句：** We need to extend the deadline.\n我们需要延长截止日期。\n","x":760,"y":24040,"width":565,"height":300},
