		{"id":"220","type":"text","text":"occur  [əˈkɜː(r)]\n*occurring, occurred, occurrence*\n\n**v.** 发生；出现；存在\n\n**例句：** The accident occurred yesterday.\n事故发生在昨天。\n","x":-440,"y":24720,"width":565,"height":300},
