		{"id":"234","type":"text","text":"perform  [pəˈfɔːm]\n*performing, performed, performance, performer*\n\n**v.** 表演；执行；履行\n**n.** 表演；执行；履行\n\n**例句：** He performed well in the exam.\n他在考试中表现良好。\n","x":760,"y":26080,"width":565,"height":300},
