		{"id":"241","type":"text","text":"associate  [əˈsəʊsieɪt]\n*associating, associated, association, associative*\n\n**v.** 联想；联系；交往\n**n.** 同事；伙伴\n**adj.** 副的；联合的\n\n**例句：** I associate him with success.\n我把他与成功联系在一起。\n","x":-440,"y":27100,"width":565,"height":300},
