		{"id":"243","type":"text","text":"attempt  [əˈtempt]\n*attempting, attempted, attempted*\n\n**v.** 尝试；试图；企图\n**n.** 尝试；试图；企图\n\n**例句：** He attempted to climb the mountain.\n他尝试爬山。\n","x":760,"y":27100,"width":565,"height":300},
