		{"id":"245","type":"text","text":"political  [pəˈlɪtɪkl]\n*politically, politics, politician*\n\n**adj.** 政治的；政治上的；政党的\n\n**例句：** He is interested in political issues.\n他对政治问题感兴趣。\n","x":160,"y":27440,"width":565,"height":300},
