		{"id":"248","type":"text","text":"complete  [kəmˈpliːt]\n*completing, completed, completion, complete*\n\n**adj.** 完整的；彻底的；完成的\n**v.** 完成；结束；使完整\n\n**例句：** He completed the task.\n他完成了任务。\n","x":160,"y":27780,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"249","type":"text","text":"complex  [ˈkɒmpleks]\n*complexity, complexly, complicate*\n\n**adj.** 复杂的；复合的；难懂的\n**n.** 综合体；复杂物\n\n**例句：** The problem is complex.\n这个问题很复杂。\n","x":760,"y":27780,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"250","type":"text","text":"impact  [ˈɪmpækt]\n*impacting, impacted, impactful*\n\n**n.** 影响；冲击；效果\n**v.** 影响；冲击；撞击\n\n**例句：** The book had a great impact on me.\n这本书对我产生了很大的影响。\n","x":-440,"y":28120,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"251","type":"text","text":"potential  [pəˈtenʃl]\n*potentially, potentiality, potent*\n\n**adj.** 潜在的；可能的\n**n.** 潜力；潜能；可能性\n\n**例句：** He has great potential.\n他有很大的潜力。\n","x":160,"y":28120,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"252","type":"text","text":"practice  [ˈpræktɪs]\n*practicing, practiced, practical, practically*\n\n**n.** 实践；练习；惯例\n**v.** 练习；实习；实行\n\n**例句：** Practice makes perfect.\n熟能生巧。\n","x":760,"y":28120,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"253","type":"text","text":"consequence  [ˈkɒnsɪkwəns]\n*consequent, consequently, consequential*\n\n**n.** 结果；后果；影响\n\n**例句：** We must accept the consequences.\n我们必须接受后果。\n","x":-440,"y":28460,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"254","type":"text","text":"present  [ˈpreznt]\n*presenting, presented, presentation, presentable*\n\n**adj.** 现在的；出席的；当前的\n**n.** 礼物；现在；目前\n**v.** 呈现；提出；赠送\n\n**例句：** He is present at the meeting.\n他出席了会议。\n","x":160,"y":28460,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"255","type":"text","text":"media  [ˈmiːdiə]\n*medium, mediate, mediation*\n\n**n.** 媒体；媒介；方法\n\n**例句：** The media reported the news.\n媒体报道了这个消息。\n","x":760,"y":28460,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"256","type":"text","text":"tradition  [trəˈdɪʃn]\n*traditional, traditionally, traditionalist*\n\n**n.** 传统；惯例；传说\n\n**例句：** We should respect traditions.\n我们应该尊重传统。\n","x":-440,"y":28800,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"257","type":"text","text":"decline  [dɪˈklaɪn]\n*declining, declined, declination*\n\n**v.** 下降；衰退；拒绝\n**n.** 下降；衰退；拒绝\n\n**例句：** The company's profits declined.\n公司利润下降了。\n","x":160,"y":28800,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"258","type":"text","text":"previous  [ˈpriːviəs]\n*previously, prior, precedence*\n\n**adj.** 以前的；先前的；早先的\n\n**例句：** We discussed this in the previous meeting.\n我们在之前的会议中讨论过这个问题。\n","x":760,"y":28800,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"259","type":"text","text":"challenge  [ˈtʃælɪndʒ]\n*challenging, challenged, challenging*\n\n**n.** 挑战；质疑；考验\n**v.** 挑战；质疑；考验\n\n**例句：** It's a big challenge.\n这是一个大挑战。\n","x":-440,"y":29140,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"260","type":"text","text":"standard  [ˈstændəd]\n*standardize, standardization, standard*\n\n**n.** 标准；水准；规范\n**adj.** 标准的；合规格的；正常的\n\n**例句：** We need to meet the standard.\n我们需要达到标准。\n","x":160,"y":29140,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"261","type":"text","text":"range  [reɪndʒ]\n*ranging, ranged, rangeable*\n\n**n.** 范围；幅度；山脉\n**v.** 变动；变化；排列\n\n**例句：** The price range is from $10 to $100.\n价格范围从10美元到100美元不等。\n","x":760,"y":29140,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"262","type":"text","text":"physical  [ˈfɪzɪkl]\n*physically, physics, physician*\n\n**adj.** 物理的；身体的；物质的\n\n**例句：** He has physical strength.\n他有体力。\n","x":-440,"y":29480,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"263","type":"text","text":"identify  [aɪˈdentɪfaɪ]\n*identifying, identified, identification, identity*\n\n**v.** 识别；认出；确定\n\n**例句：** Can you identify the man?\n你能认出那个人吗？\n","x":160,"y":29480,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"264","type":"text","text":"affect  [əˈfekt]\n*affecting, affected, affection, affective*\n\n**v.** 影响；感动；侵袭\n**n.** 情感；引起感情的因素\n\n**例句：** The weather affects our mood.\n天气影响我们的心情。\n","x":760,"y":29480,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"265","type":"text","text":"subject  [ˈsʌbdʒɪkt]\n*subjecting, subjected, subjective, subjectivity*\n\n**n.** 主题；学科；主语\n**adj.** 服从的；易受…的\n**v.** 使服从；使遭受\n\n**例句：** The subject of the meeting is important.\n会议的主题很重要。\n","x":-440,"y":29820,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"266","type":"text","text":"define  [dɪˈfaɪn]\n*defining, defined, definition, definitive*\n\n**v.** 定义；规定；限定\n**n.** 定义；清晰度\n\n**例句：** Please define the word.\n请定义这个词。\n","x":160,"y":29820,"width":565,"height":300},
		{"id":"267","type":"text","text":"product  [ˈprɒdʌkt]\n*producing, produced, production, productive*\n\n**n.** 产品；产物；结果\n**v.** 生产；制造\n\n**例句：** The company produces high-quality products.\n公司生产高质量的产品。\n","x":760,"y":29820,"width":565,"height":300},
